# Production overrides of the backend's dev/liquidsoap/radio.liq
# (deploy-init-plan.md D3, 11.2): a unified diff below these comment lines,
# applied with `patch` by scripts/check-backend-sync.sh. config/liquidsoap/
# radio.liq is the dev script at v${BACKEND_TAG} with this patch applied.
#
# Empty on purpose: the dev script takes every startup value from the
# environment, and docker-compose.yml sets the production values (the
# backend URLs on http://backend:8090, OUTPUT_STATE_FILE, ICECAST_TLS=true,
# the secrets). The stream itself (host, port, mount, TLS, format, name)
# comes from the backend's stream.* settings at runtime (output.set). The
# script's built-in defaults (stream name "Radio Atlantida", log level 3)
# are right for production. Any other difference between the two scripts
# is a bug in one of them, fixed in the backend.
